      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Download Google's Antigravity ACP server for your platform. The link is shown when adding the provider in __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__AI / LLM__TRILIUM_PH_3__. Unpack it on the device that runs Trilium.",
      "sourceHash": "887b6c8b2b6f4fa5a768c3f4e748bcffa1f5e94b9943d8210432b9817af234cd",
