      "source": "Go to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → AI / LLM and add the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__Google Antigravity__TRILIUM_PH_4__ provider. When the list of models is loaded for the first time, the Google sign-in page opens in a browser on the machine running Trilium; finish signing in there.",
      "sourceHash": "2d9dd674ed1f38ef3fbe503ddecf62bb234901a2c03a3e223f3724ab51b85281",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  Google Antigravity",
