      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_961b83af66bea3cc9b69a6a1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "NixOS",
      "sourceHash": "961b83af66bea3cc9b69a6a1bece6340eacdceb0ef1cd5d525cec945f0a84e3c",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  Google Antigravity",
      "contextHash": "48373d2daaa7a28a2ece157a823dcfd27fd5641e72345c1e35a39733fd7117aa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3f8a029255c99b231b05e2cf_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On NixOS, __TRILIUM_PH_0__ package is already available but only in __TRILIUM_PH_1__ at the time of writing. The easiest method to test it out is to use the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ with flakes:",
      "sourceHash": "3f8a029255c99b231b05e2cf10952ded77fe553b021d1f0f5bd7985246822456",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  Google Antigravity",
      "contextHash": "48373d2daaa7a28a2ece157a823dcfd27fd5641e72345c1e35a39733fd7117aa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a1a352134221d810ac4b611a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Go to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → AI / LLM and add the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ __TRILIUM_PH_3__Google Antigravity__TRILIUM_PH_4__ provider. When the list of models is loaded for the first time, the Google sign-in page opens in a browser on the machine running Trilium; finish signing in there.",
      "sourceHash": "a1a352134221d810ac4b611a2b1dea3f258a3c05be92c83fb49e8d4dfb80bf47",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  Google Antigravity",
      "contextHash": "48373d2daaa7a28a2ece157a823dcfd27fd5641e72345c1e35a39733fd7117aa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4efde6df02e48d318a3404b8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium needs __TRILIUM_PH_0__ to use Google Antigravity. It comes with Windows 10 and later, macOS and most Linux distributions.",
      "sourceHash": "4efde6df02e48d318a3404b830c59a88bb794dbcae776a8f99690c92d1f78a28",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  Google Antigravity",
      "contextHash": "48373d2daaa7a28a2ece157a823dcfd27fd5641e72345c1e35a39733fd7117aa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cd754130d1707a3abf215293_1",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Known limitations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "cd754130d1707a3abf215293f26406e0027864b87358c9e1c405e802d5cfcf23",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  Google Antigravity > Known limitations",
      "contextHash": "6a650c0353df37073882ccb4288bd6f4ae16c6710510c890e1a41f2f6e6eebcb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_040562f44ceb4de1679727f0_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The agent can only work with your notes through Trilium's note tools; its own file and shell tools are blocked for security reasons.",
      "sourceHash": "040562f44ceb4de1679727f0760104155a28f24b8ef54caa07f2a41bcb723ae2",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  Google Antigravity > Known limitations",
      "contextHash": "6a650c0353df37073882ccb4288bd6f4ae16c6710510c890e1a41f2f6e6eebcb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ca4d7e8364a91afadddf7f75_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The Antigravity ACP server requires authentication via a login link. The login link needs to be run on the same device, so it might not be possible to set up the provider while using the web version of a Docker installation. __TRILIUM_PH_0__Desktop Installation__TRILIUM_PH_1__ should work fine.",
      "sourceHash": "ca4d7e8364a91afadddf7f7506f5b0457c7d82c231d9dbc3a51f0b0f627a6a54",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  Google Antigravity > Known limitations",
      "contextHash": "6a650c0353df37073882ccb4288bd6f4ae16c6710510c890e1a41f2f6e6eebcb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_567ee179ecad03b6f6fea2af_1",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Images can be attached to the conversation, PDFs cannot. The LLM should still be able to read PDF notes and attachments via __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text Extraction (OCR)__TRILIUM_PH_1__ when the note tools are enabled.",
      "sourceHash": "567ee179ecad03b6f6fea2af4229978516f3a72fc52dac69b21de46b30c3337c",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  Google Antigravity > Known limitations",
      "contextHash": "6a650c0353df37073882ccb4288bd6f4ae16c6710510c890e1a41f2f6e6eebcb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5f75f8d3dee4162cac71108c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The results of tool calls (e.g. reading a note, writing attributes) are not properly displayed because they are not exposed by the ACP server.",
      "sourceHash": "5f75f8d3dee4162cac71108c36c86d225f7283a0c53fe634682dfc7d2e978946",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  Google Antigravity > Known limitations",
      "contextHash": "6a650c0353df37073882ccb4288bd6f4ae16c6710510c890e1a41f2f6e6eebcb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1347e195ecc75a9b0d55a143_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ OpenAI Codex__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "1347e195ecc75a9b0d55a143c2123a086d3a86bf69fcf3d4fd386f91fdba33de",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8768cb54fd8c9ae8c65b97e4_2",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This subscription-based provider is still in beta. It is safe to use (won't use additional funds and respects the terms of use), but you might experience small issues. Consider __TRILIUM_PH_0__Reporting issues__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "8768cb54fd8c9ae8c65b97e4a3b7bf02fec1baa7c94b4972c837d00555538023",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_200b99ffb084fe1c0bae4350_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "OpenAI Codex gives access to the Codex models of your ChatGPT plan (Free, Go, Plus, Pro or Business), without an API key. At the time of writing, a free ChatGPT account is enough to use it. Usage counts against your plan's Codex limits, which are small on the Free plan.",
      "sourceHash": "200b99ffb084fe1c0bae4350de1fb070283f1659e429ac0919f474a4bc6dbb91",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4bda315cccc0624db830f247_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0____TRILIUM_PH_1____TRILIUM_PH_2__ Most platforms",
      "sourceHash": "4bda315cccc0624db830f247fa9bd4ec46056d60e4648ffbb6aec932459c07c3",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1317fa2cadcd37cc5f29505f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Install the Codex CLI on the machine that runs Trilium, for example with __TRILIUM_PH_0__. As with Claude Code, for a __TRILIUM_PH_1__Server Installation__TRILIUM_PH_2__ it needs to be installed on the server. Trilium ships the ACP adapter that connects to it, so nothing else is needed.",
      "sourceHash": "1317fa2cadcd37cc5f29505f2693bcc36b36d9ef70fd8f5256e420a11310909b",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b953eae8ebc4bc61b2b2f9bf_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Go to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__AI / LLM__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and add the __TRILIUM_PH_4__ __TRILIUM_PH_5__OpenAI Codex__TRILIUM_PH_6__ provider. When the list of models is loaded for the first time, the ChatGPT sign-in page opens in a browser on the machine running Trilium; finish signing in there.",
      "sourceHash": "b953eae8ebc4bc61b2b2f9bf69bf29f8d4954b0b8d2d56c3016cc4496d5818ba",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_961b83af66bea3cc9b69a6a1_1",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "NixOS",
      "sourceHash": "961b83af66bea3cc9b69a6a1bece6340eacdceb0ef1cd5d525cec945f0a84e3c",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_28975fc434b3c2a0eed9d231_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On NixOS, Codex is available as the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ package in nixpkgs. The stable channel can lag behind Codex's releases, so a newer version can be taken from __TRILIUM_PH_1__:",
      "sourceHash": "28975fc434b3c2a0eed9d231fb1b37872b72f0e17b4195f07fa95e30a32d9f24",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e7993cde234a01db321af056_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Go to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__AI / LLM__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and add the __TRILIUM_PH_4__ __TRILIUM_PH_5__OpenAI Codex__TRILIUM_PH_6__ provider. When the list of models is loaded for the first time, the ChatGPT sign-in page opens in a browser on the machine running Trilium; finish signing in there.",
      "sourceHash": "e7993cde234a01db321af0564b4e213353c071d25e3fd2cc73356dc438e7eb71",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_81bd66f100a6cfc09155d7bb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium keeps its own Codex sign-in and settings, separate from any Codex CLI you use in a terminal, so an existing __TRILIUM_PH_0__ is not reused.",
      "sourceHash": "81bd66f100a6cfc09155d7bb01ca1de8c1b3a2df20fbc2464c2beeb6372a5157",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3fb5071f05a33cc63a83e397_0",
      "kind": "summary",
      "source": "How Trilium identifies your Codex CLI binary",
      "sourceHash": "3fb5071f05a33cc63a83e3975b9e6bcb59f021cf12813757d4a4d3bb9964bfb9",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1f939adc2e191eab3eec9268_2",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In this order:",
      "sourceHash": "1f939adc2e191eab3eec926803393bcacd08158131be85744bc460c22776dc0b",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2cb94cd72874d345d49086c7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "By looking for a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ environment variable pointing to the Codex binary.",
      "sourceHash": "2cb94cd72874d345d49086c7cc0b36165e96512ebeed41ee7ade6c0205be4579",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7aef3950bb81247dc77bcd49_1",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "By looking for __TRILIUM_PH_0__ in your PATH.",
      "sourceHash": "7aef3950bb81247dc77bcd4910dc44e9919d45e83f5e1a1d33f93a9fd049d23a",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e64d9ea35c73b074c5b7c637_1",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "By asking your login shell for its __TRILIUM_PH_0__, the same as for Claude Code.",
      "sourceHash": "e64d9ea35c73b074c5b7c637542b546a3fe26cce742aee67610bbd4476c62ea7",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6f0d673c95f6b74181c9765a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium needs __TRILIUM_PH_0__ to use OpenAI Codex, the same as for Google Antigravity: Trilium checks every tool call Codex makes through it. It comes with Windows 10 and later, macOS and most Linux distributions.",
      "sourceHash": "6f0d673c95f6b74181c9765a0b2e83e80a623c57731def7d5cf113b0d77e3813",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex",
      "contextHash": "b708e53fce05451586469fc3617a66780914ff1bb9e329138aaa312129c3614d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cd754130d1707a3abf215293_2",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Known limitations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "cd754130d1707a3abf215293f26406e0027864b87358c9e1c405e802d5cfcf23",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex > Known limitations",
      "contextHash": "c5f3ede5b03f41e55d166a8b37e64bb29c45e237cf1b9caba622a8ebe550a1af",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_68973cd1c38e8641fb2203d2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The agent can only work with your notes through Trilium's note tools, and search the web when the chat allows it; its own file, shell and other tools are blocked for security reasons.",
      "sourceHash": "68973cd1c38e8641fb2203d2aade7d47757af7210701cfc03421b50c62bdda13",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex > Known limitations",
      "contextHash": "c5f3ede5b03f41e55d166a8b37e64bb29c45e237cf1b9caba622a8ebe550a1af",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0a0512613eadc90fdf8ca849_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The ChatGPT sign-in opens in a browser on the device running Trilium, so it might not be possible to set up the provider while using the web version of a Docker installation. __TRILIUM_PH_0__Desktop Installation__TRILIUM_PH_1__ should work fine.",
      "sourceHash": "0a0512613eadc90fdf8ca8495777062bf801a16b2ce5876902d10b83b3456223",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex > Known limitations",
      "contextHash": "c5f3ede5b03f41e55d166a8b37e64bb29c45e237cf1b9caba622a8ebe550a1af",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a4307417f46d7574902c3f67_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Images and SVGs can be attached to the conversation, PDFs cannot. The LLM should still be able to read PDF notes and attachments via __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text Extraction (OCR)__TRILIUM_PH_1__ when the note tools are enabled.",
      "sourceHash": "a4307417f46d7574902c3f675723b20c102b9cc39a7bb9a432ca034d49a9bb0f",
      "context": "Subscription-based providers >  OpenAI Codex > Known limitations",
      "contextHash": "c5f3ede5b03f41e55d166a8b37e64bb29c45e237cf1b9caba622a8ebe550a1af",
      "status": "pending",
